    "agent_last_message": "Implemented in [output/main.py](/workspace/output/main.py).\n\n- Parses `--input` and `--output`, and returns exit code `1` for invalid invocation or unreadable/malformed input.\n- Streams the input file in binary chunks, counts lines/words/bytes, tracks unique lowercase words, and produces the 10 most common words with the required sort order.\n- Writes the JSON result to the requested output path, and returns exit code `2` only for unexpected internal failures.\n\nVerified against the spec edge cases, including empty files, whitespace-only files, trailing newlines, tie ordering, and malformed UTF-8. `python -m py_compile` also passes."
